  "body": "MOVE-IN READY WITH ROOM TO MAKE IT YOUR OWN!\r\n\r\nRecently refreshed with brand-new carpet and fresh interior paint, this home is ready for its next owners to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nStep outside and discover two lovely outdoor entertaining areas: a covered deck, perfect for year-round entertaining, and an open rear deck, ideal for soaking up the sunshine and enjoying summer barbecues.\r\n\r\nThe backyard is a blank canvas, offering an exciting opportunity for a keen gardener or landscaper to create something special and add their own personal touch.\r\n\r\nWith four bedrooms, two bathrooms and fantastic outdoor potential, this property offers a wonderful opportunity to secure a home in the popular Gulf Harbour area.\r\n\r\nMove in, make it yours and let your imagination run wild!\r\n\r\nImmediate possession available. Our super motivated vendor's instructions are to present all offers.",
